Description: Runs 'SPICE3' circuit netlists (operating point, DC sweep,
    transient, small-signal AC, pole-zero, noise, distortion, transfer
    function and sensitivity analyses) on 'Dune', a circuit simulator
    written in 'Rust' and derived from Berkeley 'SPICE3f5' and, in
    parts, from 'ngspice', against which it is validated. Results come
    back as long tibbles ready for plotting, and plots can be read from
    and written to 'SPICE3' rawfiles for exchange with other simulators.
    This is an independent project, not affiliated with or endorsed by
    the University of California, Berkeley or the 'ngspice' project.
